00:34:22.240 --> 00:34:25.850
It's the police!

00:34:25.850 --> 00:34:27.270
Hey! Let me through!

00:35:15.040 --> 00:35:15.620
What?

00:36:37.770 --> 00:36:40.760
It would have been too late if you had come to the cave.

00:36:40.760 --> 00:36:43.960
I heard that religion doesn't suit Mars.

00:36:43.960 --> 00:36:46.360
If anything, I'll listen.

00:36:46.360 --> 00:36:48.850
My partner was killed by a cyborg.

00:36:48.850 --> 00:36:52.060
Then you can help me.

00:36:52.060 --> 00:36:53.040
Ahaha

00:36:53.040 --> 00:36:58.580
Robots are so similar to humans that they are likely to be killed.

00:36:58.580 --> 00:37:00.000
Ah...

00:37:10.360 --> 00:37:12.200
Alright, here we go.

00:37:39.370 --> 00:37:50.870
I'm just getting rid of the illegal robots. Why are you chasing me like this?

00:38:04.920 --> 00:38:10.350
Don't get in my way.

00:38:10.350 --> 00:38:13.260
Hey, there's still more to go.

00:38:13.260 --> 00:38:15.280
It's called S.A.R.D.

00:38:30.220 --> 00:38:31.890
What's wrong with my legs?

00:38:37.550 --> 00:38:38.870
What's wrong with you?

00:38:38.870 --> 00:38:40.570
You're such a fool, aren't you?

00:38:40.570 --> 00:38:43.850
You're being selfish, aren't you?

00:38:43.850 --> 00:38:46.120
You're going to replace me with another person,

00:38:46.120 --> 00:38:47.890
and become a cyborg, aren't you?

00:39:06.170 --> 00:39:23.860
What?

00:39:23.860 --> 00:39:26.460
The God of Friends?

00:39:26.460 --> 00:39:28.080
Let me tell you.

00:39:28.080 --> 00:39:29.760
There's no God here.

00:39:30.000 --> 00:39:40.380
Drunk Lord, why can't I forgive you?

00:39:40.380 --> 00:39:43.390
Why are you on the side of robots?

00:39:43.390 --> 00:39:46.710
Why do you believe in the existence of S.W.A.R.D?

00:39:46.710 --> 00:39:48.500
I'll tell you.

00:39:48.500 --> 00:39:54.960
Because that's how my blood, my fate, will pass.

00:39:54.960 --> 00:39:56.790
Okay.

00:40:01.240 --> 00:40:05.540
That's because I'm a third person!

00:40:05.540 --> 00:40:07.430
What did you say?!

00:40:07.430 --> 00:40:09.610
Teishi...

00:40:09.610 --> 00:40:11.890
Why?!

00:40:11.890 --> 00:40:14.080
My reason doesn't have your name on it!

00:40:41.070 --> 00:40:44.950
I will show you the proof of S.A.R.D, the power of S.A.R.D!

00:41:36.360 --> 00:41:39.430
That's right. I'm a monster!

00:41:39.430 --> 00:41:43.120
Then what are you going to do? Destroy us? What are you going to do?

00:41:43.120 --> 00:41:46.460
If it's the source of evil, or if it's a social evil...

00:41:46.460 --> 00:41:55.530
Then why did humans create us?

00:41:55.530 --> 00:42:00.000
Stop it! Don't kill us!

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:03.290
Amiteiji, you're a police officer, aren't you?

00:42:03.290 --> 00:42:07.800
Robots are not human enemies.

00:42:07.800 --> 00:42:09.760
On the contrary, they are.

00:42:09.760 --> 00:42:11.430
Isn't that right?

00:43:16.640 --> 00:43:29.380
- Keiji! - Is that Shoto?

00:43:30.090 --> 00:43:38.810
Pull yourself together! Hey! Hey!

00:43:38.810 --> 00:43:41.830
Midori! Pull yourself together!

00:43:41.830 --> 00:43:43.280
Open your eyes!

00:44:02.650 --> 00:44:04.450
I don't know anything about you!

00:44:04.450 --> 00:44:07.920
You don't know anything about me!

00:44:07.920 --> 00:44:12.290
Oi...

00:44:12.290 --> 00:44:13.380
Goodbye.

00:45:01.630 --> 00:45:10.080
At night, at the emergency exit, I drop it down.

00:45:10.080 --> 00:45:21.410
At the scrap factory, next to me, a kitten is crying.

00:46:00.890 --> 00:46:05.990
I wonder when

00:46:33.160 --> 00:46:36.280
Cooling

00:47:05.120 --> 00:47:06.630
I am S.A.R.D.

00:47:06.630 --> 00:47:08.870
But I have a feeling.

00:47:08.870 --> 00:47:10.080
It's a memory.

00:47:10.080 --> 00:47:12.000
Where are the S.A.R.D. members?

00:47:12.000 --> 00:47:13.750
Please, answer me!

00:47:14.560 --> 00:47:16.320
I'm in the S.A.R.D.

00:47:16.320 --> 00:47:17.510
EPISODE 2

00:47:17.510 --> 00:47:19.110
FLESH AND STORM

00:47:19.110 --> 00:47:21.440
DOS, don't follow me.
